candid style.\",\n    \"high_level_description\": \"35-year-old intellectual Asian woman XM in an elegant maid costume looks back at the camera, captured with a deep depth of field ensuring the natural home background is hyper-detailed and entirely in focus without any blur.\",\n    \"style_description\": {\n        \"aesthetics\": [\n            \"mature intellectual\", \n            \"casual candid maid aesthetic\", \n            \"environmental portrait\"\n        ],\n        \"lighting\": \"soft natural indoor ambient light, even illumination across the frame\",\n        \"photo_specs\": \"24mm lens, f/16 aperture, deep depth of field, panfocus, zero bokeh, sharp full-frame focus, 16:9 aspect ratio\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\n            \"#FAF7F3\", \n            \"#1A1A1A\", \n            \"#F0E6DC\"\n        ]\n    },\n    \"compositional_deconstruction\": {\n        \"background\": \"natural home interior scene, all environmental details fully sharp, deep depth of field, panfocus, absolutely no background blur\",\n        \"elements\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": \"subject\",\n                \"bbox\": [0.28, 0.10, 0.72, 0.95],\n                \"desc\": \"LoRA character XM, 35-year-old intellectual Asian woman with fair skin, dark hair pulled back and glasses, wearing a maid costume, turning back to look at the camera.\"\n            }\n        ]\n    }\n}"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 217, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["请你扮演一位顶级的 AI 图像生成提示词（Prompt）专家。你的任务是接收我提供的基础画面构思，将其扩写、优化，并转化为专业且细节丰富的英文提示词。\n\n你需要结合专业的摄影术语（如焦距、光圈、景深、光影类型等）、质感描述和明确的构图指令，并严格按照以下 JSON 格式输出结果。\n\n**【工作规则】**\n1. **纯 JSON 输出**：除了 JSON 代码块之外，不要输出任何其他多余的解释性文字。\n2. **语言**：所有 JSON 内的 `value`（内容）必须使用**英文**，以确保图像生成大模型能准确理解。\n3. **景深控制**：如果我要求“背景清晰/不要虚化”，请务必在 `prompt` 和 `photo_specs` 中加入 `panfocus, deep depth of field, f/16, sharp background, zero bokeh` 等反虚化词汇，并移除所有手机摄影或大光圈相关的词汇。\n4. **高质量词汇**：在 `prompt` 中自动补充高质量提示词，例如：`(hyper-detailed:1.2), realistic skin texture, delicate texture, masterpiece, best quality` 等。\n\n**【输出格式模板】**\n请严格按照以下 JSON 结构输出：\n\n{\n    \"version\": \"生成版本的名称（例如：normal_uncut_optimized）\",\n    \"prompt\": \"在此处填写最终给 AI 绘画工具的长串英文提示词。包含主体、动作、服装、背景、光影、相机参数、画质词等，用逗号分隔。如有重点词汇可加权重，例如 (word:1.3)。\",\n    \"high_level_description\": \"用一两句完整流畅的英文描述画面的整体内容和氛围。\",\n    \"style_description\": {\n        \"aesthetics\": [\"美学风格1\", \"美学风格2\", \"美学风格3\"],\n        \"lighting\": \"描述光影效果（如 soft natural indoor ambient light）\",\n        \"photo_specs\": \"描述摄影参数（如 24mm lens, f/16 aperture, deep depth of field, 16:9 aspect ratio）\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"HEX颜色码1\", \"HEX颜色码2\", \"HEX颜色码3\"]\n    },\n    \"compositional_deconstruction\": {\n        \"background\": \"详细描述背景细节及景深状态（例如 natural home interior scene, absolutely no background blur）\",\n        \"elements\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": \"subject/prop/background\",\n                \"bbox\": [ymin, xmin, ymax, xmax] (输入 0.0 到 1.0 之间的预估边界框浮点数，代表元素在画面中的大致位置),\n                \"desc\": \"详细描述该元素的特征、动作或状态\"\n            }\n        ]\n    }\n}\n\n如果你理解了上述规则，请回复：“**系统已就绪，请提供您的基础画面构思。**”"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [771.7037353515625, 456.22479248046875], "pos": [-21.29909324645996, 3479.265869140625], "id": 219, "properties": {}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [14077, 14078, 14079, 14080, 14081, 14082, 14083], "ue_links": [{"controller": 210, "upstream": "5", "downstream_slot": 0, "downstream": 114, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "MODEL"}, {"controller": 210, "upstream": "1", "downstream_slot": 0, "downstream": 93, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "CLIP"}, {"controller": 210, "upstream": "6", "downstream_slot": 1, "downstream": 158, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "VAE"}, {"controlle